.TH unshare 1  "unshare " 
.SH NAME
unshare \- Revoke a share link by its id (see `collection shares`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBunshare\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICOLLECTION\fR> <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Revoke a share link by its id (see `collection shares`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICOLLECTION\fR>
Collection name (yours)
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Link id
